span.p:
CHECK 2 · Canonical-template conformity
recompute BlockTemplate_r, HeaderTemplate_r and TemplateID_r;
every non-nonce consensus-critical field must match the committed template

CHECK 4 · Successful-nonce range membership
recompute seed_r, the tickets, the ordered list L_r and the ranges;
verify that n_success ∈ R_r(m_winner)

Check 4 verifies range membership of the SUCCESSFUL candidate header only;
it does NOT prove that every non-winning miner searched its complete
assigned range (§5.8.5, §5.11.5).

Winner publishes B₀ = committed template + successful nonce;
all nodes verify the complete header, the proof of work,
the transactions and the template commitment
